<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-1441-1" style="padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/solution/529-disbursements?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=pdg_2022" alt="Ascensus recently selected Flywire as their digital payment partner." target="_blank" style="display: 
block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="240" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/19a3wkdmbl/en_us/images/60216eb98b9c1-1612803769.5718.png" alt="Ascensus recently selected Flywire as their digital payment partner." title="Digitize 529 Disbursement Payments to your Institution" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 240px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
