<td width="100%" align="center" valign="top" style="width: 100%;"> 
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; text-size-adjust: 100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="color: #48b985;">Digitize 529 Disbursement Payments to your Institution</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Thanks for attending Flywire’s session at PDG Bursars SFS last week! Do you know what else was last week? Earth Day! Saving trees is important, of course, but it isn’t the only benefit of Flywire’s 529 Disbursement solution:<br />‌<br /></span></p> 
<ul style="margin-left: 15px; padding-left: 0px; list-style-position: inside; margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="color: #0f476b;">Reduce checks and inbound mail for greater security and process efficiency</span></li> 
<li><span style="color: #0f476b;">Automatically receive digital payments and speed reconciliation</span></li> 
<li><span style="color: #0f476b;">Increase accuracy with unique student identifiers on every disbursement</span></li> 
<li><span style="color: #0f476b;">Reduce service inquiries and requests as a result of real-time tracking<br /><br /></span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Would you like to discuss how you can streamline the 529 disbursement process by enabling digital payments directly to your institution? (And save everyone some paper!)<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Learn more </span><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/industries/education/solution/529-disbursements?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=pdg_2022"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a><span style="color: #0f476b;">, and request a call or reply to this email to discuss how your institution can benefit from Flywire’s 529 Disbursement solution!<br />‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">Thanks, </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="color: #0f476b;">The Flywire Team</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
